OL,3,GNEWSAElderly woman dies after two
OL,4,Avehicle road crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn elderly woman has died after a road
OL,7,Fcrash in Coleraine on Saturday.
OL,9,FShe's been named by police as
OL,10,F85-year-old Maud Kerr, from the
OL,11,FMacosquin area.
OL,13,FPolice received a report at about 12.30
OL,14,FBST of a crash involving two-vehicles
OL,15,Fon the Windyhill Road.
OL,17,FThe emergency services attended, but
OL,18,FMrs Kerr died at the scene.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
